# Canvas hardening lockdown

- `/canvas` is the only official current Canvas route.
- `/canvas-v4` and `/canvas/resend-command-preview-v2` must remain absent.
- `/canvas-legado` must remain available.
- The official route component is `CanvasWorkspace`; versioned preview names are forbidden.
- The homologated Canvas Sass hash is protected even when files are renamed.
- State belongs to the React Flow state owner.
- Persistence crosses the typed repository contract and MSW handlers.
- Browser-only MSW code loads dynamically after confirming `window` exists.
- Never add localStorage, sessionStorage or window.location.
- Tests, hooks, fixtures, adapters and mocks stay colocated with their owner until genuinely shared.
- `shared` must not depend on private Canvas implementation details.
- Run `npm run validate:canvas:release` before merge.
